# Enforce LF endings for scripts. A CRLF creeping into a .sh file via a
# Windows checkout breaks `bash -n` / execution on the Linux and macOS
# targets this repo installs onto - LF must stay authoritative regardless
# of which OS clones the repo.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets - never text-normalize, always diff as binary.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
